WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:15.228
Mrs. Rice: Oh my! What was that?

2
00:00:15.229 --> 00:00:17.269
I knew it! I knew it!

3
00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:20.435
Mrs. Rice: There is a giant in there.

4
00:00:20.436 --> 00:00:23.156
Mrs. Rice: Hey! What's going on in there?

5
00:00:23.157 --> 00:00:24.819
Let me in.

6
00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:28.120
Mrs. Rice: There's a giant in there! I know it!

7
00:00:28.121 --> 00:00:35.302
Mrs. Rice: I'm going to find that giant if it's the last thing I do!

8
00:00:35.303 --> 00:00:37.075
Brad: That's not good.

9
00:00:37.076 --> 00:00:40.248
Bello: It would be all right if it were me.

10
00:00:40.249 --> 00:00:43.062
Tina: But it's not you, it's Danny.

11
00:00:43.063 --> 00:00:47.378
Chuck: And it's definitely not all right!

12
00:00:47.379 --> 00:00:50.498
Danny: Oh no! What happened to me?

13
00:00:50.499 --> 00:00:52.066
Mrs. Rice: Let me in.

14
00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:55.290
There's a giant in there, I know it.

15
00:00:55.291 --> 00:00:57.377
Tina: Danny, Danny!

16
00:00:57.378 --> 00:01:00.668
Bello: We're down here.

17
00:01:00.669 --> 00:01:02.672
Danny: You'll have to talk louder.

18
00:01:02.673 --> 00:01:05.086
You sound like insects.

19
00:01:05.087 --> 00:01:07.031
Brad: Quick, lock the doors.

20
00:01:07.032 --> 00:01:09.387
Mrs. Rice is trying to get in.

21
00:01:09.388 --> 00:01:11.659
Mrs. Rice: Open up in there!

22
00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:13.507
Danny: Good idea.

23
00:01:13.508 --> 00:01:20.544
Tina's neighbor is starting to be a real problem.

24
00:01:20.545 --> 00:01:22.767
Mrs. Rice: I heard that! I heard that!

25
00:01:22.768 --> 00:01:26.464
I am going to stop you, you evil giant!

26
00:01:26.465 --> 00:01:28.709
Danny: I'm not evil!

27
00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:31.246
Mrs. Rice: It spoke to me!

28
00:01:31.247 --> 00:01:36.680
The giant spoke to me!

29
00:01:36.681 --> 00:01:38.986
Danny: There, that will stop her.

30
00:01:38.987 --> 00:01:42.870
Okay, now for the other door.

31
00:01:42.871 --> 00:01:45.196
Dave: Ahh! Look out.

32
00:01:45.197 --> 00:01:49.668
Brad: This way!

33
00:01:49.669 --> 00:01:55.376
Tina: Danny is dangerous at this size!

34
00:01:55.377 --> 00:01:58.178
Danny: There, I locked both doors.

35
00:01:58.179 --> 00:02:01.227
Bello: Danny, you're going to have to be more careful.

36
00:02:01.228 --> 00:02:03.467
Tina: You scared Brad's cat.

37
00:02:03.468 --> 00:02:08.893
Dave: You scared us too!

38
00:02:08.894 --> 00:02:11.345
Danny: I can't believe what happened to me.

39
00:02:11.346 --> 00:02:13.278
How did it go wrong, Brad?

40
00:02:13.279 --> 00:02:16.610
Danny: I thought you said the shrink-gun would work this time.

41
00:02:16.611 --> 00:02:18.340
Bello: But it did work.

42
00:02:18.341 --> 00:02:21.324
Dave: It worked a little too well, that's all.

43
00:02:21.325 --> 00:02:22.993
Brad: Don't worry, Danny.

44
00:02:22.994 --> 00:02:24.604
We'll figure it out.

45
00:02:24.605 --> 00:02:26.169
Chuck: Bello is right.

46
00:02:26.170 --> 00:02:27.957
The shrink-gun worked.

47
00:02:27.958 --> 00:02:30.257
It did unshrink Danny.

48
00:02:30.258 --> 00:02:33.589
Tina: Danny had nano-putty all over his clothes.

49
00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:36.448
Maybe that's why he's so big.

50
00:02:36.449 --> 00:02:39.110
Brad: And remember, water fell on me.

51
00:02:39.111 --> 00:02:41.838
It might have caused the problem.

52
00:02:41.839 --> 00:02:43.937
Bello: Is the shrink-gun broken?

53
00:02:43.938 --> 00:02:45.610
Brad: It looks okay.

54
00:02:45.611 --> 00:02:48.328
I wish I had my computer.

55
00:02:48.329 --> 00:02:49.996
Tina: Where is it?

56
00:02:49.997 --> 00:02:52.710
Brad: I left it behind at the mites' fort.

57
00:02:52.711 --> 00:02:56.813
Brad: If I had it, I could use it to adjust the shrink-gun perfectly.

58
00:02:56.814 --> 00:02:59.580
Dave: I think we should just try it again.

59
00:02:59.581 --> 00:03:02.636
Bello: Yes. We should try to get Danny back to normal.

60
00:03:02.637 --> 00:03:06.731
Brad: Okay, let me dry it off first.

61
00:03:06.732 --> 00:03:10.408
Chuck: I really hope it works this time.

62
00:03:10.409 --> 00:03:12.304
Tina: Get ready, Danny.

63
00:03:12.305 --> 00:03:15.229
Brad's going to try the shrink-gun again.

64
00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:20.171
Danny: Okay, I'm ready when you are.
